    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW266b2wAzfAJMBjD5JpGuLWE)_\n\n## Merge order\n\n- Independent; removes part of #507 (already merged).\n\n## What changes\n\n- Removes the Hammerspoon `Cmd+Shift+D` binding from `devonthink.lua`, since DEVONthink already does it natively.\n- Removes the code only that binding used: the inspector and sidebar patterns, `hidePanel`, `selectChecked` and `submenuItems`.\n- Keeps `Cmd+Z` (undo the latest highlight), `Caps+x` and `Caps+c`, and `DEVONthink.dumpMenu()`.\n\n## Manual testing\n\n- [x] Reload Hammerspoon: no error in the console.\n- [x] In DEVONthink, Cmd+Shift+D does DEVONthink's own action.\n- [x] Cmd+Z still removes the latest highlight, and otherwise undoes normally.\n- [x] Caps+x and Caps+c still work.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiCTb5QFPFZUd9wzRgq)_",
